# Review policy for this repo (see docs/REVIEW-TIERS.md). The gates themselves are human-tier.
default human
agent docs/**
agent claude/designs/**
agent examples/**
agent tests/**
human bin/**
human claude/hooks/**
human claude/settings.json
human claude/guard.conf
human install.sh
human tests/test_guardhook.sh
human tests/test_review_tier.sh
human tests/test_merge_tools.sh
